{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello。 Rotty♪でちゅ ! ! !"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/11/19/3521567/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さん 今日もステキな１日にしてくださいね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてそして、《ろってぃー,かずみ,まいやん,みさ,れいか,》のユニット曲『 私のために誰かのために♪ 』が\n解禁したんやけど 聴いてくれたかなん？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"聴いたよ〜 って方は 感想よろちくでちゅ!!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーいや、\n先週の土曜日は『MUSIC FAIR』\nミュージックフェア見てくれたかなん？？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今週も引き継ぎ 出演しているので是非見てねん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は 寝る前に 漫画読んでまちた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/11/19/3521567/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"実は 実家に帰った時に、姉からちょっくら\n借りてきたんだぁ〜 今度返す！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"STARBUCKS ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mahiro.kawamura/img/blog/mahiro.kawamura/img/2013/11/19/3521567/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大阪から東京へ移動はする時の\nRottyのおきまりパターン."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新大阪駅でスタバ買って 新幹線乗り込む(*^.^*)\nちなみに これはカプチーノ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とゆーことで  授業うけてこよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆もがんば〜？  ろってぃー\nばいば〜い(*´ω｀*)♪"}],"source":"archive"}